abstract: >-
  Research fork maintained by Marcus Hermansson. It records an incomplete
  Riemann-hypothesis attempt, associated Lean mathematics, finite arithmetic
  calculations, source-bound research tooling, and 43 archived manuscripts.
  The inherited Zeta23 formalization is separately attributed in NOTICE,
  UPSTREAM_README.md, UPSTREAM_AUDIT.md and the source headers. This citation
  record does not assert a completed RH proof or change any licence terms.
